                                    <path d="M2.46154 4.8H4.92308V8.4H17.2308V4.8H19.6923V10.8H22.1538V4.8C22.1538 3.48 21.0462 2.4 19.6923 2.4H14.5477C14.0308 1.008 12.6769 0 11.0769 0C9.47692 0 8.12308 1.008 7.60615 2.4H2.46154C1.10769 2.4 0 3.48 0 4.8V21.6C0 22.92 1.10769 24 2.46154 24H9.84615V21.6H2.46154V4.8ZM11.0769 2.4C11.7538 2.4 12.3077 2.94 12.3077 3.6C12.3077 4.26 11.7538 4.8 11.0769 4.8C10.4 4.8 9.84615 4.26 9.84615 3.6C9.84615 2.94 10.4 2.4 11.0769 2.4Z"
